@@ -74,12 +74,16 @@ ROOF COVERING RULE (v1.5): for every roof face (RF-n) set material to the coveri
 
 FACE COLOR RULE (v1.4): for every face, fill color with the dominant surface color: hex (sRGB), a short human name, and confidence. Add secondary_hex for a clear second tone on the same face (e.g. brick mortar). Shadow, white balance and color cast shift hues - reflect that in confidence and note it in color.note (e.g. "face in shadow in all photos"). This drives 3D rendering only; it is never a paint-order color.
 
